const body = "<section class=\"wrap\"><article class=\"article\"><a class=\"back\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog.html\">← All posts</a><div class=\"ameta\"><b>AI Tools</b><span>2026-08-07</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h1>Hook AI: The Copy Engine I Built to Write Conversion-Ready Hooks</h1><p>Copy is the highest-leverage part of marketing. A hook decides whether an ad gets read, a headline decides whether it gets clicked, and an offer decides whether it gets bought. The catch is that none of it works from one attempt — you need volume of angles, then testing. That's the job I built Hook AI to do.</p><h2>The job is never one good ad</h2><p>Clients ask for \"an ad\". The reality is you need dozens of hooks and headlines per campaign, across different niches, before the data tells you which angle wins. Writing that volume by hand is slow and inconsistent. So I made an engine that generates it at scale and stays on-brand.</p><h2>What it ships</h2><p>Hook AI is a Marketing Copy Engine that writes conversion-ready hooks, headlines and ad copy across 15+ niches. It doesn't stop at copy — it bundles its own full SEO program to build topical authority around the content, email flows to keep leads moving, and A/B hero testing so the winning variation surfaces instead of guessing.</p><ul><li>Hooks, headlines and ad copy across 15+ niches</li><li>Built-in SEO program around generated content</li><li>Email flows for nurture and reactivation</li><li>A/B hero testing to pick the winner with data</li></ul><h2>Built like a product, not a prompt</h2><p>It's a real SaaS with payments, not a chat wrapper. Next.js for the app, Supabase for the data, TypeScript for the code, Razorpay for billing, and Groq for fast generation — deployed on Vercel. You can pick a niche and get usable output immediately.</p><blockquote>The best hook in the world can't save an ad nobody reads — but the right hook makes the read inevitable.</blockquote><h2>Why this matters for how I work</h2><p>Hook AI is proof of the one thing that separates me from a lot of marketers: I don't just plan the strategy, I build the tool that executes it. Strategy, design, build, launch and growth — the full cycle, solo. Try the live engine and generate a few hooks for your own niche <a href=\"https://hook-ai-marketing-engine.vercel.app\">here</a>.</p><hr style=\"margin:36px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--line)\"/><p style=\"color:var(--muted)\"><b style=\"color:var(--accent2)\">Vamshidhar</b> — performance marketer who builds AI tools. Open to work. <a href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/contact.html\">Contact →</a></p></article></section>";
